<p>Conjure void stars that orbit you, defending you from incoming attacks. Each time an attack deals more than 10% of your maximum life, a star will be consumed to reduce the damage taken by <acronym class="talent-variable" title="Values for<br>talent levels 1-5,<br>talent mastery 1.00">10%, 22%, 30%, 35%, 39%,</acronym> of which 40% will be dealt to you as entropic backlash.</p><p>You regenerate 1 star every <acronym class="talent-variable" title="Values for<br>talent levels 1-5,<br>talent mastery 1.00">14, 12, 11, 9, 9</acronym> turns, stacking up to 4 times.</p><p>This talent will only function in light armor.</p>